      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu biro ebyo, Hezekia arwara muno aija kufa. Aho omurangi Isaya eya Amozi amugoba, amugambira ati, “Ogwo n'Omukama ngu oshemeze ebyawe aha rw'okuba tolikwija kukira, noija kufa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia ahinduka aleba orukuta, ashaba aha Mukama ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ati, “Mukama wange ninkutagiliza, oijuke okwo ntura ninkukolera n'obwesigwa n'omutima gwange gwona, ebikushemelera nibyo mbaho ninkora.” Ashuba alira muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo Omukama Ruhanga yagambiire Isaya ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ogende ogambire Hezekia oti, Omukama Ruhanga wa sho nagamba ati, Enshara yawe nagihulira, n'okulira nabona okwo walira; mbwenu ndakwongeraho emyaka 15 y'oburora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe na Yerusalemu ndabakiza omu mikono y'omukama wa Asiria, kandi ekigo ndakilinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama yakuha akabonero aka. Omanyireho okwo ebyo yakuraga arabikora kwo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngu aragarura ekinyumanyumi enyuma entambi 10 aha matembero agakozirwe Ahazi, mtuli eizoba lyabaire nilitera. Eizoba ligarukeyo entambi 10.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia kayarugire omu burwaire, yahandika oruhoya oru rw'esiimi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya akaba agambire kabakwata omukate gw'etini kugumuteka aha kizimba akakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Hezekia ashangwa yatulize akabonero ako yakumanyireho okwo yakukizire akashobora kugya Rwensinga y'Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
